["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"48. OpenAI的權力遊戲：臉譜、硅谷精英政治與諷刺意味 alignment nerdy AB 票機制 OpenAI LP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-11-21-zhangxiaojun-openai-政变-非营利董事会为何能踢走-ceo/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3d2ee30a56796488-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 政變：非營利董事會為何能踢走 CEO</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一個 700 人、成立不到 5 年的公司，6 人非營利董事會行使一次權力就幹成了政變——而它最大的股東微軟連董事會成員都不是。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>13</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"47. 接班百億基金的瑣碎小事：徐小平和他的門徒 IC sourcing carry principal lateral hire imposter\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-11-16-zhangxiaojun-真格交接-徐小平退场后-合伙人收不了年轻人的税/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/498f3b318cf5e723-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>真格交接：徐小平退場後，合夥人收不了年輕人的稅</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真格用全員 sourcing 和項目個人 ownership 對抗初代優勢的消失——每個 logo 只掛一個人名下，合夥人不能靠決策養尊處優。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風投</span><span class=\"tag\">真格基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"46. 失去逍遙子的第一個雙十一：詭計、大混戰與小陽謀 shopping mall 海景房 SK 商家\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-11-11-zhangxiaojun-双十一没有逍遥子-平台在分蛋糕-商家在赔本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7e8cca90f911c8b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>雙十一沒有逍遙子：平臺在分蛋糕，商家在賠本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">雙十一的複雜不是設計出來的，是幾十條行業線各自往一個 APP 上疊玩法疊出來的；平臺拿走約一半，商家一年幾十億盤子只剩幾百萬利潤。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">電商</span><span class=\"tag\">雙十一</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"44. 談諾貝爾經濟獎與40+消失在黃金階梯上的女人 greedy jobs quiet revolution marriage bar statistical discrimination\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-28-zhangxiaojun-女性职场起步领先-生育惩罚却把优势磨光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/48345482b5ed098b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">53:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>女性職場起步領先，生育懲罰卻把優勢磨光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">剛畢業時男女就業參與率幾乎一樣，過十年女性就落下來了，再過十幾年又部分回去——這條曲線與生育時間高度吻合。被磨掉的不是能力，是連續的積累。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">性別經濟學</span><span class=\"tag\">生育懲罰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"43.【汽車史話03】從“盛產管理大師”的通用汽車，看美式車企百年榮辱 BU T型車 take home pay Telematics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-22-zhangxiaojun-通用汽车盛产管理大师-是因为创始人被赶走了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a723fc2ffc4b4ee2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>通用汽車盛產管理大師，是因為創始人被趕走了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人杜蘭特被財團掃地出門，反而讓通用成了職業經理人的土壤——斯隆的BU制、德魯克的管理學都長在這裡。家族不放手的福特，則始終沒有職業經理人的位置。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車產業</span><span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"42.【汽車史話02】集權者福特與全球第二暢銷T型車的衰落 vertical integration\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-18-zhangxiaojun-t型车曾占全球市场一半-却因19年不换代被通用取代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70e535c84a96bcfc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">50:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>T型車曾佔全球市場一半，卻因19年不換代被通用取代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">福特靠一款車讓普通人買得起汽車，T型車一度佔據全球汽車銷量的一半以上；但正因為它只有一個品種、一個顏色、十九年不換代，消費者沒有換車的理由，市場被通用拿走。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車史</span><span class=\"tag\">福特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"41.【汽車史話01】世界上第一輛燃油車、女車手和慈禧太后 Red Flag Act Otto cycle Whiz Kids\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-15-zhangxiaojun-汽车只是马车上加个发动机-马车公司却一家没活下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e3a530c55a91b164-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">51:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>汽車只是馬車上加個發動機，馬車公司卻一家沒活下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">汽車不是馬車上加一臺發動機那麼簡單：動力總成換了，整個技術棧和市場跟著換，當年造車廂的馬車公司沒有一家活過百年。今天衡量電動車企，看的是它能不能掌控上游的電池。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車史</span><span class=\"tag\">內燃機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"29. 逆全球化思潮來勢洶洶，外企CEO何故密集訪華？ CDR 紅籌架構 FDI 國際版\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-06-12-zhangxiaojun-外企ceo密集访华-逆全球化是政治问题-不是经济问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb0b83ff98bdb00e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">50:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>外企CEO密集訪華：逆全球化是政治問題，不是經濟問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">逆全球化來勢洶洶卻擋不住CEO們排隊來華，因為脫鉤違反經濟規律；但真正推動脫鉤的不是經濟邏輯，而是老大防老二的政治邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美關係</span><span class=\"tag\">外資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"25. OpenAI開源、亞馬遜新動作，全球大模型格局走向何方 vertical copilot LLM transformer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-16-zhangxiaojun-大模型底层战争已结束-垂直副驾驶才是老炮的机会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ffbd8664f0cee8a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">55:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>大模型底層戰爭已結束，垂直副駕駛才是老炮的機會</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">底層大模型是年輕人借微軟算力做出的湧現，但真正賺錢的行業副駕駛屬於創業老兵——三分之二的垂直機會已被ChatGPT自己幹掉，剩下的是數據、社交和商業模式的組合戰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">垂直副駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"20. The Information前記者空降巴西，她的拉美商業遊記 warm intro growth VC fund Rappi Mafia The Edge of Democracy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-21-zhangxiaojun-巴西像七八年前的中国-但中间公司活不下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/23388c61192213d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">52:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0321</span></div>\n<h2>巴西像七八年前的中國，但中間公司活不下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴西的稅收和勞工法讓大公司和小團隊都能活，唯獨中間規模的公司被夾死；政治左右搖擺本身是確定的，創業者把它當成可控制的變量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">拉美</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"19. 硅谷銀行危機未結束：未來風險傳導的3個可能 FDIC MBS beginning of the end end of the beginning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-15-zhangxiaojun-硅谷银行倒闭-美联储只保存款人-不保股东/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46b66f8e0ad7b880-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">36:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0315</span></div>\n<h2>硅谷銀行倒閉：美聯儲只保存款人，不保股東</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美聯儲做了一個黑白分明的決定：三萬戶機構存款人全額保護，股東血本無歸。這不是雷曼時刻，而是一個時間差——但美國信譽的慢性下滑可能才剛開始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷銀行</span><span class=\"tag\">美聯儲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"6. 顯微鏡下的硅谷大裁員：一筆筆現實經濟賬 Level.FYI Cobra H1B P&amp;L IC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-11-21-zhangxiaojun-meta-裁员补偿-4-n-2-有绿卡是幸福-没绿卡是倒计时/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/32e62e38accb0559-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">33:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>Meta 裁員補償 4+N/2：有綠卡是幸福，沒綠卡是倒計時</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一場 Meta 裁員，有綠卡的人拿著十幾萬美金去新公司上班，沒綠卡的人要在四個月內、還是節假日窗口裡找到下一份工作，否則就得離開美國。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷裁員</span><span class=\"tag\">Meta</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"3. 宇航員與機器人：漫談深邃浪漫的ROBOT新知 in-hand manipulation DARPA Robotic Challenge silver bullet product market fit DLR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-10-zhangxiaojun-让机器人削个土豆就能当院士-这比登火星更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd4230dec43e1a9d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">58:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>讓機器人削個土豆就能當院士，這比登火星更難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">登火星的技術人類大部分已經有了，只是個經濟問題；但怎麼讓機器人在廚房裡工作，人類現在還不知道，甚至還沒有思路——誰能讓機器人削個土豆，可以當院士。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"2. 和曹巍聊聊馬斯克、機器人恐怖谷和《西部世界》 uncanny valley iToF SLAM 力控\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-03-zhangxiaojun-人形机器人最难的环节不是走路-是穿针剥虾/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2834a742a2c9e6e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">55:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>人形機器人最難的環節不是走路，是穿針剝蝦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">雙足行走和自主導航都能沿襲特斯拉自動駕駛的積累，精準力控和觸覺不能——那要模擬人的皮膚，開車時根本用不到。第一版、第二版機器人大概只到人的 20% 到 30%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"1. 和投資人夢秋聊聊加州、投資寒潮和林黛玉 Bubble Burst 持幣待購\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-07-11-zhangxiaojun-资本寒冬不是缺钱-是大家都在持币待购/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8e3f2f9d0bed1e26-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">54:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0711</span></div>\n<h2>資本寒冬不是缺錢，是大家都在持幣待購</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「資本寒冬」每兩三年就被喊一次，通常六到八個月就過去。這次不一樣：兩頭在外的美元通路被打斷，不是沒錢，而是不知道該怎麼投。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一級市場</span><span class=\"tag\">資本寒冬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"串臺《硅谷101》｜TikTok如何在Facebook眼皮底下成長起來？ UP 值 UG 中臺 Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-16-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-在-facebook-眼皮底下长大-靠的不是产品而是体系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83f0cc536109ca7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">38:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 在 Facebook 眼皮底下長大，靠的不是產品而是體系</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">字節贏在體系而非個人：推薦算法、UG 中臺、商業化三套系統疊加 Musical.ly 的產品殼，再用對標 Facebook 的 UP 值打法下狠手投放，才跑出全球第五大社交應用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"《TikTok內幕：張一鳴的巨浪征途》音頻版（下集） UG PMO GDPR All-Hands Meeting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-05-zhangxiaojun-不留空档全面压制-tiktok-花-100-亿美元砸出护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3c064d7b78c0bb1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">45:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0505</span></div>\n<h2>不留空檔全面壓制：TikTok 花 100 億美元砸出護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 全球化的第一推力是錢和一條暗號：幾年間投入約 100 億美元買量、補貼內容、砸服務器，對手要攔至少得準備 200 到 300 億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">字節跳動</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"《TikTok內幕：張一鳴的巨浪征途》音頻版（上集） ARPU Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-04-29-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-曾是-facebook-最尊贵的客户-直到日活破亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/297c1019274060ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">35:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0429</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 曾是 Facebook 最尊貴的客戶，直到日活破億</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 早期最重要的投放渠道是 Facebook，推廣預算每個季度增長 100% 以上；Facebook 認定它留存太差、留不住用戶，反而把流量導給它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>"]